meta {
  name: Privacy: another writer undoes my dismissal
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/pieces/{{pieceId}}/related/{{otherPieceId}}/dismissed
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  As the second writer: expect 404, and nothing changes for you. Run "Not related" as yourself first, so there is a dismissal to undo; afterwards, as yourself, the dismissed piece must still be gone from "What Ink sees beside a piece".
}
